warning: Lint[5655] This is a cross-boundary edge. Although the caller is in package pkg1 via __PackageOverride('pkg1') and the callee is in package pkg1 via __PackageOverride('pkg1'), together those package overrides are load-bearing here: without them the caller stays in package pkg1 and the callee stays in package pkg2, which pkg1 cannot reach, so this edge would be an error. This edge prevents removal of the __PackageOverride attributes and SHOULD BE REMOVED. Either move the callee into a package that pkg1 can reach via hg mv, use __RequirePackage (if the whole function should only be invoked from pkg2) or gate this reference via a package check (if this portion of the function is meant to be gated by an environment check). [1]

